{"product_id":"the-never-boys","title":"The Never Boys","description":"\u003cp\u003eDean Mason is a boy with many secrets, running from the law and his own personal demons On the run from the law, Dean Mason gets a job on a sheep farm. There, he finds a series of letters written by Clive during World War II. Dean eventually discovers that Clive only pretended to go to war in order to persuade his girlfriend and family that he was really fighting for his country. This is a compelling story capturing the spirit of Australian outback while following a boy fighting his own personal demons.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:23 x 203  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Scott Monk \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781741660067 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 340\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44376022122649,"sku":"2RG9781741660067","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/f231a15505a46740c7af77e40d4ac0e5.jpg?v=1716459554","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-never-boys","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}